      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (‘‘Board’’). There is established,\neffective February 15, 1997, a Board of three members to be appointed\nby the President to investigate this dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily\nor otherwise interested in any organization of airline employees or any\nair carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the availability\nof funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1997,
      "char_start": 1882,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13036#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13036#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "62 FR 7653, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "c589a3502365c84ad1c96aed3ad2c1099fdd764daf3f89f6d301cb8edcf5e4cc",
        "signing_date": "1997-02-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13036.txt",
        "text_sha256": "8e7ee910331a310d6e8b490c91585658369f1cf3c4a12734d1bfb54958606c56",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1997-02-19/pdf/97-4302.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to\nthe dispute within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2329,
      "char_start": 1998,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13036#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13036#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "62 FR 7653, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "c589a3502365c84ad1c96aed3ad2c1099fdd764daf3f89f6d301cb8edcf5e4cc",
        "signing_date": "1997-02-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13036.txt",
        "text_sha256": "8e7ee910331a310d6e8b490c91585658369f1cf3c4a12734d1bfb54958606c56",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1997-02-19/pdf/97-4302.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 10 of the Act, from\nthe date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board\nhas submitted its report to the President, no change in the conditions out\nof which the dispute arose shall be made by the parties to the controversy,\nexcept by agreement of the parties."
    },
